BenchGo composes @linxin666/dsh-ssh 0.4.15 (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web, dsh-better-sidebar 0.30.1 (MIT), https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar, @huanlin/dsh-plugin-better-sidebar-plugin-audio 0.1.0 (MIT), https://github.com/huanlinoto/dsh-plugin-better-sidebar-plugin-audio, and dsh-video-preview 0.1.4 (MIT), https://github.com/zemul/dsh-video-preview.
Build-time adaptations remove the sidebar settings and installation catalog, use built-in defaults, bound audio analysis, and route media through the authenticated BenchGo workspace service. The video descriptor uses the shared BenchGo player for loading, error and retry states. SSH requires an explicitly confirmed host key; optional installation telemetry is omitted. Original installed packages and upstream Harness sources are not modified.
